<title>POLAND: KETY WINS PLN 10 MLN CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>KETY WINS PLN 10 MLN CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish aluminium plant Kety SA signed a contract worth about 10 million zlotys with Polish food producer Kaliskie Zaklady Koncentratow Spozywczych Winiary SA on supplying it with wrapping foil, Kety said in a statement on Monday. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
